# @module examples.verify.euclid.book-i
# @means  Equal triangles on the same base are in the same parallels.
# @from   euclid — Elements, Book I, Proposition 39
# @tier   derived
# @needs  «Geometry» «Euclid Book I» «Proposition 37: triangles on the same base and parallels are equal»

theorem «Geometry» «Euclid Book I» «Proposition 39: equal triangles on the same base lie between parallels» () {
    assume triangles_ABC_and_DBC_equal_on_same_base_BC
    assume «Geometry» «Euclid Book I» «Proposition 37: triangles on the same base and parallels are equal»()
    therefore lines_AD_and_BC_are_parallel
    therefore triangles_ABC_DBC_same_parallels
}